flowchart TD
  subgraph Repository
    canon[Canonical docs under docs source]
    contracts[Contracts and prompt templates]
    gen[Generated docs under docs generated]
  end

  subgraph CI generation job
    loader[Contract loader]
    assembler[Deterministic evidence assembler]
    renderer[Prompt renderer with delimited evidence]
    router[Provider router from ai config]
    model[Single model call with one repair retry]
    gates[Deterministic quality gates]
    stamp[Provenance stamp with content hashes]
  end

  canon --> assembler
  contracts --> loader
  loader --> assembler
  assembler --> renderer
  renderer --> router
  router --> model
  model --> gates
  gates --> stamp
  stamp --> pr[Pull request on docs-gen branch]
  pr --> review[Human review and approval]
  review --> gen
  gen --> build[Static Docusaurus build]
